/*****************************************************************************
    firstLight is A4's form, on paper: the smallest form worth drawing, cut down
    from IncantForms/Windows/simple. Nothing draws it yet. See the notes below bail().
*****************************************************************************/
register(FORMs);
define
    firstLight window x=300 y=450 width=400 height=200 down fill:=wall font:=normalFont color:=blue
        heading="First Light" text height=43 font:=titleFont color:=green align=center bottomBorder;
        words="This text is poured into its frame. It should wrap at the frame's width and stop at the frame's height, and the form should report how much of it fit." text fill:=white align=justify;
        bar across height=35
            space;
            ok="OK" text width=60 border strokeColor:=red fill:=lightGreen align=center valign=center;
    ;
bail();

Spelled to the forms plan's rulings. Style attributes sit on fields and are scoped to the subtree: font=normal holds for
everything under firstLight, and heading overrides it by naming font=title. fill is not inherited, so each field names its
own. bottomBorder is the ruled side spelling (Tony, 2026-11-04); the plan's A4 section carries the count and the walk.

Cut from simple, and why:
    onLayout code={}   event firing comes after A4
    text=one           one field showing another field's text is a field reference; the listener's family, parked
    two                a red block holding nothing
    pad                dropped by ruling (Tony, 2026-11-04)
    three, stuff, wrap the nesting that existed to carry text=one
    width=50.0%        the % is parsed as a Modifier and the width reads 50; a percentage needs its own spelling
    rounded            a border is enough for first light; rounded waits for the drawing step
    the name simple    UnitTests already has a field named simple, and the define merged into it

Added: down, a text field that pours, and a field shaped like A4's button. Nothing fires. It is plain text with a border
until event firing comes through it. The word button stays out because nothing reads it (formsTable).

Read it with IncantForms/WorkingOn/firstLightRead.
